WEBVTT

00:21:28.094 --> 00:21:30.505
So what leads to a spectacular
pivot like that?

00:21:31.018 --> 00:21:32.929
A dose of novelty.

00:21:32.953 --> 00:21:35.193
Research shows that curiosity
is a key factor

00:21:35.217 --> 00:21:37.718
that can help you find
creative peaks as you age,

00:21:37.742 --> 00:21:38.916
rather than decline.

00:21:39.819 --> 00:21:42.582
This is one way to stay productive
and maintain motivation

00:21:42.606 --> 00:21:44.035
later in your career.

00:21:44.059 --> 00:21:45.559
Find something new to explore.

00:21:46.610 --> 00:21:49.118
For you, novelty might mean
switching to a new team

00:21:49.142 --> 00:21:50.427
or a new market,

00:21:50.451 --> 00:21:52.665
getting certified in a fresh skill set,

00:21:52.689 --> 00:21:56.124
or mastering a hobby
completely outside your experience.

00:21:56.491 --> 00:21:58.544
For Lyn, that hobby was fashion.

00:21:59.519 --> 00:22:02.038
LS: I've always had, sort of,